{"id": "86268", "name": "החלפת בסיס לוגריתם – log_a(xⁿ) בעזרת ln (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Given that \\(\\ln(a)={{CT:0}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Express:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\log_{a}(x^{{CT:1}}) \\]</p><p>as a single multiple of a natural logarithm.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\log_{a}(x^{{CT:1}}) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> The power rule brings the exponent down as a factor; the change of base formula turns \\(\\log_a\\) into a natural logarithm divided by \\(\\ln(a)\\), whose value is given.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The laws of logarithms</b><br>Below are the basic rules of logarithms.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\log_{b}(mn) = \\log_{b}(m) +\\log_{b}(n) \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\log_{b}\\left(\\frac{m}{n}\\right) = \\log_{b}(m) -\\log_{b}(n) \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\log_{b}(m^n) = n\\cdot\\log_{b}(m) \\]</p>and the change of base formula<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\log_{a}(m)=\\frac{\\log_{b}(m)}{\\log_{b}(a)} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Applying them</b><br>Hence, by the power rule and then the change of base formula with \\(b=e\\) (the natural logarithm),<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\log_{a}(x^{{CT:1}}) = {{CT:1}}\\log_{a}(x) = {{CT:1}}\\frac{\\ln(x)}{\\ln(a)} \\]</p>and substituting the given value of \\(\\ln(a)\\),<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[  = {{CT:1}}\\frac{\\ln(x)}{{CT:0}}={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Check the Log Laws</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Check the Log Laws</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "correctanswer", "n", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 50}